      "writtenOn": "2022-07-19T18:16:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we do sk_sp\u003cSkVertices\u003e, this would be `this-\u003esetVertices(std::move(geom.fVertices)); geom.setType(Type::kEmpty);`.\n\nnit: if formatting it like the kSubRun case doesn\u0027t let the first two statements fit on one line, let\u0027s move the setVertices call to a new line. We also don\u0027t need the {} around the block because we aren\u0027t declaring any variables inside the case statement.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 39,
        "startChar": 40,
        "endLine": 39,
        "endChar": 74
      },
      "revId": "7ed706a93e568df346c5ec6b33d2a9264ac93674",
